    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43997" root="&#xA;                        نطع&#xA;                    " body-key="n1">
                        
                            5
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَنَطَّعَ</span></b> 
                        , (KL,) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تنطّع فِى الكَلاَمِ</span>, (S, K,)
<i>He went deeply,</i> or <i>far, in speech;</i> (KL;) syn.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَعَمَّقَ</span>: (S, K:) <i>was exorbitant,</i> or <i>extravagant,
therein:</i> (K:) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تنطّع</span> signifies <i>he spoke with
the extremity of his fauces;</i> [or <i>with a guttural
voice;</i>] from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">النِّطْعُ</span> signifying the upper <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غار</span> in
the mouth. (IAth.)

